
# Lab 06 — Windows Task Scheduler

## Objective
Inspect scheduled Windows maintenance tasks.

## Environment
- OS: Windows 11 Pro
- Account: BUTLERLAB\Administrator
- Tool: Task Scheduler (taskschd.msc)

## Procedure
1. Opened Task Scheduler.
2. Navigated to Task Scheduler Library.
3. Expanded Microsoft > Windows.
4. Located the Windows Defender scheduled tasks.
5. Identified the Periodic Maintenance task.

## Findings
- Located the Periodic Maintenance task.
- Inspected scheduled task entries.

## Skills Practiced
- Windows Task Scheduler navigation.
- Scheduled task identification.
- Windows maintenance administration.

## Result
Successfully located and inspected a scheduled Windows maintenance task.
